  description: a note from counsel.
  logText: OFFICE OF COUNSEL. PRIVILEGED. You asked if the halon exposes us. Having
    it does not. 1994 stopped the making of it, not the keeping of it, and recycled
    agent is lawful with the paperwork. What exposes us is a person hurt in a room
    we knew was wrong, or a release we could have prevented. Please do not use the
    word "knew" in your reply.
